  I am not particularly enthusiastic about the prospect: partly due to my position, and partly due to my lingering confusion.

  Still, I resolve to get my head in the game. Rokuhara may be a blight on Yamato, but that doesn't make them fair game for terrorists. Two wrongs, as they say, do not make one right.

